# Elena brand rule
- Public role: `Психолог · гештальт-подход`.
- Brand line: `Опора внутри. Движение дальше.`
- Primary palette comes from `brand/assets/02_palette/palette.json`.
- Prefer brand icons and markers under `brand/assets` over generic icon packs.
- Visual direction: premium editorial, warm strength, lots of controlled whitespace, strong serif headlines + clean sans UI.
- Photography: use only provided Elena crops; never stretch images.
- Avoid medical, clinic, SPA and generic coaching aesthetics.
- Avoid public positioning words: лечение, пациент, диагноз, психотерапевт/психотерапия, guaranteed result.
